        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 72 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis long length, 72 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull would look awesome on larger doors. It will also make a big statement on standard sized doors, with its modern, sleek appearance and its 6 foot size. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 72 Inch Door Handle is made from high quality stainless steel. The Oil Rubbed Bronze finish is a deep brown--almost black--and uniform. The Kian Door Pull is 72-3/4 inches long with 72 inch mounting centers. Choose from back to back, surface mounted, or thru-bolt mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>24 Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>36\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>48\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/60-inch-kian-oil-rubbed-bronze-door-pull\"><b>60\" Kian Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL72-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 72-3/4\" (1848mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 72\" (1828mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL72-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL72 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "72 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull",
                "description": "This long length, 72 Inch Kian Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull would look awesome on larger doors. It will also make a big statement on standard sized doors, with its modern, sleek appearance and its 6 foot size. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Kian 72 Inch Door Handle is made from high quality stainless steel. The Oil Rubbed Bronze finish is a deep brown--almost black--and uniform. The Kian Door Pull is 72-3/4 inches long with 72 inch mounting centers. Choose from back to back, surface mounted, or thru-bolt mounted.",
